{
	"name": "LiveConnect 01 — Configurar webhook del proxy",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Paso 0 — Configurar el webhook del canal\n\nRegistra la URL de tu chatbot (workflows 03/04) como webhook del canal en LiveConnect.\n\n1. Ejecuta el workflow: lista los canales de la cuenta.\n2. En **Set Webhook** reemplaza:\n   - `id_canal`: el ID del canal que quieres conectar (sale del nodo anterior)\n   - `url`: la URL **Production** del Webhook de tu chatbot (ej. `https://tu-n8n.com/webhook/liveconnect-chatbot`)\n   - `secret`: un secreto propio (LiveConnect lo reenvía para que valides las llamadas)\n\nPara desactivar el webhook: `estado = 0`.",
				"height": 320,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
			"name": "Instrucciones",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [0, -100]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
			"name": "Ejecutar manualmente",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [480, 40]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "channel",
				"operation": "getMany",
				"filters": {}
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
			"name": "Listar canales",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-liveconnect.liveConnect",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [700, 40]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"resource": "proxy",
				"operation": "setWebhook",
				"id_canal": "={{ $json.id }}",
				"url": "https://TU-N8N.com/webhook/liveconnect-chatbot",
				"estado": 1,
				"secret": "cambia-este-secreto"
			},
			"id": "b1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
			"name": "Set Webhook",
